{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"da5deb1bfdc57cfa7dc99f19b7b515a34ee7ae04ee7c1ac42b569e98b3be2303","ja":"CLEVER CLOVERゲネプロ公演の約6週間前、\n台本が配られてから数日が経過したときのこと……。","zh":"CLEVER CLOVER彩排公演约6周前，剧本发下来几天后发生的事……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a1885324cea15c37641aa481d5b5471c42a23675d010ef83a635f23d0b86ae88","ja":"なるほど……。これはこっちの文献にも\n書いてあったわね……となると……。","zh":"原来如此……这边的文献里也有记载呢……这么说来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"15a011d4a0d8e51ebbb925f9e21f75f7cfbb008de929dd7c2b82ab8c8fa9d12a","ja":"わあっ、本がすっごくいっぱい！\nりつこ、これぜんぶ読むの！？","zh":"哇，好多好多书！\n律子，这些全都要读吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8a5745c8d7ecf52d5e616684e049dcae92d7a7dcc0ee8881f2d3fdbb4170768d","ja":"ふふ、そうよ。ほら、今度の劇って設定が\n凝ってるでしょ？　だから勉強しておこうと思って。","zh":"呵呵，是啊。你看，这次的剧设定很精巧吧？所以我想先好好学习一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"930b0602609ffe877dbed7decca73143b99e85f216be970576f6c801a290c363","ja":"そっか……今度のお話って難しいよね……。\nたまき、まだよくわからないぞ……。","zh":"原来如此……这次的话题确实很难懂呢……\n环，还不是很明白……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0840f96eff830f1d4b9c8aeaa34a0c5f9035073ec514a179fe920d17adffdddf","ja":"……そうだ！　たまきも本、読んでみる！\nりつこみたいに勉強したら、わかるようになるよね！","zh":"……对了！环也来试着读书！\n只要像律子那样学习，就能看懂了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a8823bb6e12b3234470a103c25b53086178384f6ce7bbf1ba6bb7fa9bb3a0f9e","ja":"あ～……でもここにある本は、ちょっと……。","zh":"啊～……不过这里的书，有点……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b4c87a7969dabfde5bf988319cc677b8d62107ca7e99b7e982216a6a2f4d6652","ja":"……ぜ、全然わかんないぞ。\n難しい漢字ばっかりだし……。","zh":"……完、完全搞不懂啊。\n净是些难懂的汉字……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"079dce12f2ede561e172d6fe2fe37472bc7544b3c7da967586b19bdb4b178078","ja":"郷土文化や信仰の専門書ばかりだから、\n無理ないわよ。","zh":"都是关于乡土文化和信仰的专业书，没办法的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"607d70ebfa3d639399836017b0b51e2c20d769b764869b9cc77d543c2984238f","ja":"うう……たまきには、この本早かったかも……。\nりつこ、もっとかんたんな本ある？","zh":"呜呜……这本书对小环来说，可能还是太早了……\n律子，有没有更简单的书？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"73c88e75b2c620c391d3f2681f808b6e8e26821ee0e9354ee4ace04d70c9fb26","ja":"そうねぇ……。もともと難しい題材だし、\nちょうどいいのが見つかるかしら……。","zh":"是啊……毕竟本来就是很难的题材，能不能找到合适的呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b5d283650a94c58b98bb34d3720aadb95356194d9b9747ba21d128de2143e402","ja":"……あ、そうだ。ねえ、ちょっと時間をくれない？\n2日くらいあれば、何とかなると思うから。","zh":"……啊，对了。那个，能给我一点时间吗？\n我觉得只要有大约2天，应该就能想办法解决。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_987.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0b162867f1d12e354dc60e03c265fd6deb932bd04f31492c9482bf1a2763e99f","ja":"うん、わかった！\nたまき、楽しみに待ってるね！","zh":"嗯，知道啦！\n小环会开心地等着哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
